# 24 GB line = w13b + P2 (1.2.0). w13b is the configuration the 24 GB card gate passed (Tue 10 Nov 08:41; BigMoE
# data/stack/card_w24d_env.txt at blob e06f495e). P2 adds R57_P2=256,R57_P2_ROWS=13,R57_P2_VERIFY=0: the arm EvalSuite's P2
# gate passed (Wed 11 Nov 19:51, EvalSuite 8adeb09; BigMoE data/stack/card_w24p2_env.txt line 2 at blob 6ff0296f, the env
# line below verbatim).
# P2 (LOSSY, gated): a prompt of 256 tokens or fewer skips the prefill and runs as 13-row plain forwards on the decode's
# check path. On 12 IFEval prompts the first token took 1.12 s (median) instead of 3.11 s, the whole decode 31.4 vs 31.2
# tok/s, the lifetime peak 23.00 vs 23.70 GB (BigMoE W24T, Thu 12 Nov 00:31). Such a prompt's answer differs from the
# prefill path's (2 of 12 equal); the gate found the scores the same (IFBench -1.33 pt, p 0.80; GPQA Diamond's 67 prompts of
# <= 256 tokens -2.99 pt, p 0.63; 5 longer-prompt controls token-identical). Longer prompts take w13b's prefill unchanged.
# Pools: 141 base + 26 sidecar slots (14.87 GB); every check verifies at most 13 rows; QOM (optional expert uses served only
# when resident) on humaneval, mbpp and lcb6, exact expert reads elsewhere (IFBench, GPQA, chat); only the 4-bit DFlash2
# drafter (R57_D7B=all). lossy-24 and chat-24 are this one gated configuration.
# Decode loop: engine/loop/r57_screen_w24p2.py (BigMoE 5f53556): the gate's loop byte for byte = w24's (rel1's + R57_ROWCAP /
# R57_GATEREQ / U3W / R57_HARD) + P2 v0 and its runs.json field; with R57_P2 unset it runs exactly as w24's.
# Memory label: under 24 GB on prompts up to about 500 tokens, more on longer ones (28.2 GB at 30K; the gate: 22 of 40 processes
# crossed 24.0 GB, the shortest prompt at a first crossing 561 tokens). R57_PFCHUNK below stays 1024: smaller prompt chunks
# change the tokens (W24e).
SNAPSHOT=w24p2
C=100
BIGMOE_EXT_BUILD=build_qom,R57_REFTOK=,R57_FAST=QOM,R57_D17=1,R57_HC8=1,REF2_HC8_FAST=1,R57_DNR=1,R57_HCB=1,REF2_SMALL_NATIVE=1,R57_D7BNAX=1,REF2_OOO_1C=1,R57_NAX=1,REF2_NAX_1CQ=1,REF2_DN_KS=1,REF2_GDN_LAZY=1,D7BNAX_32=2,R57_FASTTAX=1,R57_SBN=2,R57_DSUB=1,R57_SVH=1,R57_RELAX_SPAN=1,R57_RELAX_SPAN_RULE=R2:2:0.25,R57_COPY=g2,REF2_KEEP_CACHES=1,R57_WIRED=1,BIGMOE_PAUSE_EVERY_MS=50,R57_S0CARRY=1,REF2_SB_FIRST=1,REF2_PLE_LATE=1,REF2_COMMIT_SUB=9,R57_DQ1=1,REF2_NAX_COH=1,R57_VTIER=,BIGMOE_TIER_CM=141,BIGMOE_TIER_CL=26,R57_ROWCAP=13,REF2_TIER_CHUNK=1,BIGMOE_TIER_PF_GROUP=64,R57_CACHE_GB=0.25,R57_D7B=all,R57_HARD=1200,R57_P2=256,R57_P2_ROWS=13,R57_P2_VERIFY=0,R57_QOM_SETS=humaneval,mbpp,lcb6
# Prefill rows per chunk (the gate ran the default 1024; W24e decides 1024 / 512 / 256): one line to change.
R57_PFCHUNK=1024
